# Routine "Midday burn check": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every weekday around midday, catches a spend spike the same day it happens, but only when a live source is connected.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/fuse && pi -p "/midday-burn-check"
